### Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@aliceId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### Create a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eve"
}

### Get a seeded user
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{aliceId}}

### List Alice's chats with member IDs (create one first in chat.http)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{aliceId}}/chats

### Validation error: empty name
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### Validation error: bad UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/123

### Not found: valid UUID that doesn't exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999
